---

<section class="newsletter-section">
  <div class="newsletter-card">
    <div class="badge-row">
      <span class="badge">⏳ Launching Soon</span>
    </div>

    <h2>Weekly Exam Prep Is Coming Soon...</h2>
    <p class="description">
      I'm currently putting together a newsletter for you to receive exam questions, topic discussions and more every single week!
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
    .newsletter-section {
        margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
    }

    .newsletter-card {
        background: var(--bg-card);
        border: var(--border-mega);
        box-shadow: var(--shadow-hard);
        border-radius: var(--radius-cartoon);
        padding: 1.75rem 1.5rem;
        text-align: center;
        margin: 0 auto;
        position: relative;
        overflow: hidden;
    }

    .badge {
        display: inline-block;
        font-family: var(--font-code);
        font-weight: 700;
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        padding: 0.25rem 0.65rem;
        border: var(--border-thick);
        border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
        background: var(--accent-lime);
        color: var(--color-black);
        box-shadow: 2px 2px 0px var(--color-black);
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    h2 {
        font-family: var(--font-heading);
        font-size: 2.2rem;
        color: var(--text-primary);
        line-height: 1.1;
        margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }

    .description {
        font-size: 1rem;
        color: var(--text-secondary);
        line-height: 1.5;
        max-width: 700px;
        margin: 0 auto 1.5rem auto;
    }

    .coming-soon-pill {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
        background: var(--accent-pink);
        color: var(--color-black);
        font-family: var(--font-heading);
        font-weight: 800;
        font-size: 1rem;
        border: var(--border-thick);
        border-radius: 12px;
        box-shadow: var(--shadow-hard-sm);
        cursor: default;
    }

    .form-subtext {
        font-family: var(--font-code);
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        color: var(--text-secondary);
        margin-top: 1.25rem;
        opacity: 0.85;
    }
</style>